                <pb facs="0855" n="767" sameAs="frus:frus1904/pg767"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Mr. Loomis to Mr.
                            McCormick.</hi></head>
                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.—Paraphrase.]</seg></opener>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Department of State</hi>,<lb/><hi rendition="#italic"
                                >Washington</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1904-09-19"><hi rendition="#italic">September 19,
                        1904</hi></date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>(Mr. Loomis instructs Mr. McCormick to forward to the Department Count
                    Lamsdorff’s note and his supplemental instructions to the prize court and naval
                    commanders. The Department will then send further instructions.)</p>
            </div>
        </body>
